# Budgety Design System

## Source of truth

Stitch project [9083140746767418409](https://stitch.withgoogle.com/projects/9083140746767418409) — assets in `stitch-assets/`, icons in `src/components/icons/` + `public/icons/stitch/`. User screenshots (Home / Transaction / Analytics / Profile / Add sheet) drive the mobile shell.

## Stack

- **Next.js App Router** + React 19
- **Tailwind CSS** for layout, spacing, color utilities
- Shared UI: `@common/*`, `@components/icons`, `@components/mobile`, `@components/screens`

## Tokens (Stitch light — Luminous Precision)

| Token                   | Value                 | Where                                      |
| ----------------------- | --------------------- | ------------------------------------------ |
| Primary / brand         | `#4343D5`             | `STITCH_COLORS`, `tailwind` `primary.main` |
| Primary container / FAB | `#5D5FEF`             | CTAs / FAB (`primary-light`)               |
| Soft surface            | `#FAF8FF` / `#F2F3FF` | `bg-surface`, `bg-surface-low`             |
| Income                  | `#008259`             | `text-income`                              |
| Expense                 | `#FF4D4D`             | `text-expense`                             |
| Card radius             | 16px                  | `rounded-card`                             |
| Font                    | **Geist**             | `font-sans`                                |
| Currency                | ₹ INR                 | `useCurrencyFormatter`                     |

Prefer **light** Stitch screens and user reference screenshots. Dark Stitch “Budgety Web” / Obsidian Flux is layout reference only — do not switch the whole app to dark unless light screens lack a feature.

Do not use `lucide-react` or `@mui/icons-material`. Icons are Stitch Material Symbol SVGs from `@components/icons`.

## Navigation IA (4-tab Stitch shell + secondary)

### Primary (bottom nav + FAB)

| ID             | Screen                                              | Stitch icon    |
| -------------- | --------------------------------------------------- | -------------- |
| `overview`     | Home (dashboard + budget progress + upcoming bills) | `home`         |
| `transactions` | Transaction list / calendar + import                | `receipt_long` |
| `analytics`    | Income / Outcome / Budget tabs                      | `bar_chart`    |
| `profile`      | Profile + settings + secondary links                | `person`       |
| FAB            | `AddTransactionSheet`                               | `add`          |

### Secondary (reachable; not in bottom nav)

| ID        | How to reach                                               |
| --------- | ---------------------------------------------------------- |
| `bills`   | Home “View All”, Profile → Bills, `/bills`                 |
| `goals`   | Profile → Goals, `/goals`                                  |
| `budgets` | Analytics Budget “View All”, Profile → Budgets, `/budgets` |
| `reports` | Analytics / download, `/reports`                           |

Desktop sidebar lists primary then secondary.

## Components

- Shared UI: `src/components/common/` → `@common`
- Mobile Stitch primitives: `src/components/mobile/`
- Icons: `src/components/icons/` (Stitch SVGs only)
- Screens: `src/components/screens/*`
- Shell: `AppShell`, `BottomNav` (+ FAB), `Sidebar`, `TopBar`

## Patterns

- Mobile-first; bottom nav `md:hidden`, sidebar `hidden md:flex`
- Content padding bottom `pb-28` for FAB clearance
- Amounts: green `+` income, red `-` expense
- Cards: white / `rounded-card`, soft shadows
- Primary CTAs: `bg-primary-main`

## Data / Auth

- All budget data is per Firebase Auth user in Firestore collections scoped by `userId`
- Never show another user’s imports
